        <recommendedGroups>SECP256R1</recommendedGroups>
        <recommendedGroups>ECDH_X25519</recommendedGroups>
        <tls13>true</tls13>
        <minGroupCount>2</minGroupCount>
    </namedGroupsGuidelineCheck>
    <keySizeCertGuidelineCheck>
        <name>4.5. Public Key Length</name>
        <requirementLevel>MUST</requirementLevel>
        <atLeastOneCertificateShallPass>false</atLeastOneCertificateShallPass>
        <minimumDsaKeyLength>0</minimumDsaKeyLength>
        <minimumRsaKeyLength>2048</minimumRsaKeyLength>
        <minimumEcKeyLength>224</minimumEcKeyLength>
        <minimumDhKeyLength>2048</minimumDhKeyLength>
    </keySizeCertGuidelineCheck>
    <hashAlgorithmsGuidelineCheck>
        <name>In addition, the use of the SHA-256 hash algorithm is RECOMMENDED and SHA-1 or MD5 MUST NOT be used [RFC9155] (for more details, see also [CAB-Baseline], for which the current version at the time of writing is 1.8.4).</name>
        <requirementLevel>SHOULD</requirementLevel>
        <condition>
            <property>SUPPORTS_TLS_1_2</property>
            <result>TRUE</result>
        </condition>
        <algorithmsInQuestion>SHA256</algorithmsInQuestion>
        <recommended>true</recommended>
    </hashAlgorithmsGuidelineCheck>
    <hashAlgorithmsGuidelineCheck>
        <name>In addition, the use of the SHA-256 hash algorithm is RECOMMENDED and SHA-1 or MD5 MUST NOT be used [RFC9155] (for more details, see also [CAB-Baseline], for which the current version at the time of writing is 1.8.4).</name>
        <requirementLevel>MUST_NOT</requirementLevel>
        <condition>
            <property>SUPPORTS_TLS_1_2</property>
            <result>TRUE</result>
        </condition>
        <algorithmsInQuestion>SHA1</algorithmsInQuestion>
        <algorithmsInQuestion>MD5</algorithmsInQuestion>
        <recommended>false</recommended>
    </hashAlgorithmsGuidelineCheck>
    <extensionGuidelineCheck>
        <name>Implementations MUST NOT use the Truncated HMAC Extension, defined in Section 7 of [RFC6066].</name>
        <requirementLevel>MUST_NOT</requirementLevel>
        <condition>
            <property>SUPPORTS_TLS_1_2</property>
            <result>TRUE</result>
        </condition>
        <extensionsInQuestion>TRUNCATED_HMAC</extensionsInQuestion>
        <required>false</required>
    </extensionGuidelineCheck>
